WEBVTT

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.910
It has been lively out
there lately, hasn't it?

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.580
Indeed, they have been boisterous.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.500
I suspect that either Satomi
or Osaki lured them in.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.120
Shall I send them away?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.980
No, they're fine.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.010
It's just...

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.000
Just what?

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.380
These are honored guests
that Rio personally invited here.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.740
I wonder what they are like...

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:12.100
Divine Blessings

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.990
This is a ridiculously huge mansion,

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.760
so why aren't there any people?

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.300
A Japanese manor?

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.210
What are you doing?

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.540
J-Jeez, it's just you! You scared me!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.380
It is hardly proper for
a guest to wander about

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.860
without the master of the
house's permission, Shino.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.130
A different master
presides over that area.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.010
Even we are not allowed
to enter on a whim.

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.130
Hey...

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.320
Do you think that maybe...

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.070
Maybe you came to retrieve
me like this once before?

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:29.100
I don't remember it all that well,

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.280
but it was back when I
was a really little kid.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.070
It's hard to say.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:40.700
As you are still a small child,
that is a poor point of reference.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.660
Oh, that right?

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:47.200
Now then, about that
fire the other day...

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:54.540
Like I said, that wasn't my
flippin' fault, you dimwit!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:55.700
"Dimwit"?

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.810
Shino, now see here...

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.520
Kaname!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.050
Whoo, boy! I'm sorry; I apologize!

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:10.780
But he isn't feeding you a line.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.740
Shii merely got caught up in the action.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:19.160
Regardless, I doubt that
the Shogetsu Institute

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.810
will hold another demon hunt.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.070
Huh? For real?

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:25.110
You have a point.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.660
Myoko has suddenly retired.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:31.750
And with Seiran missing on top of that,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.190
they must have their hands full.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.830
Don't you feel sorry for them?

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:41.590
At any rate, Rio, isn't it about
time for you to be leaving?

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.530
Yeah, I'm heading out now.

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.220
Try to behave yourself,
at least for today.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:48.680
Shino...

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:50.850
Shut it!

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:01.670
Come to think of it, where does he
scamper off to all of the time?

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.520
He's clearly going to the church
to tend to his work there.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:05.720
Work?

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:10.180
Rio is a unique dean in
the special church zone.

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.120
A dean? Him?!

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:15.200
Now, now. Rio is most popular.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.620
After all, he is quite
a sight to behold.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:23.740
Plus he started out with close
ties to the royal family.

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.230
With the Imperial Church
standing behind him,

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.940
people are eager to donate while the
Church maintains that striking poster boy.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:34.140
As far as the Church is concerned,
he is the goose that lays the golden eggs.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:44.500
That aside, I haven't seen your other
friend since this morning.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.700
If you mean Sosuke, he's asleep.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.290
Is he ill?

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:53.460
He just gets sleepy on
the day of the New Moon.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:58.200
Come to think of it, your Murasame
is rather quiet today as well.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.590
The 29th day of the moon's cycle...

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.720
The day the moon hides
itself away is special.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.000
The usually noisy Murasame
silences his caws,

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.320
while Sosuke asks for nothing but sleep...

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.350
Shino, what's wrong?

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:27.220
Sosuke, he said that I
won't make it to adulthood.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.690
Am I going to die?

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.100
He won't become an adult?

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:33.880
Shino is going to die?

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:36.360
If I'm gonna die anyway,

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.840
there wasn't any point in obeying

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.300
mother and dressing
like a girl, was there?

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.960
Then don't become an adult...

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.270
Stay as you are; remain a child...

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.360
If only time would stop
with you as you are...

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:58.600
Shino...?

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.910
Oh, my bad! Did I wake you up?

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:03.620
You can go back to sleep.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.790
I'll be sure to stay by your side.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.370
I'd appreciate that!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:14.000
On the day of the New Moon,
I wind up having dreams I'd rather not.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.430
I'll take you up on that offer.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.430
Please spend the entire day
today quietly by my side.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:23.390
'Kay.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.120
He's so cute!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:38.770
Have you noticed anything different
about Sosuke since that day?

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:47.870
Even if there was something different,
isn't Sosuke still Sosuke?

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.500
Despite his request...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.030
I'm starving here!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.580
Hamaji and the foxes are all out.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.340
This stinks. I'll have
to raid the kitchen.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.030
Ouch!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.730
S-sorry! You okay?

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.960
So Shii ran into Ayane?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.080
Ayane?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.730
Ayane Mizuki.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.840
Chosen by a snake spirit,

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.310
she is a member of the
Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.210
This is most unusual!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:44.080
She hardly ever leaves her wing.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.430
And you've got the devil's luck, Shii.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.160
Why?!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.470
Snake spirits are vindictive.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:54.440
If you did anything to Ayane,
it might have gobbled you up headfirst.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:55.850
I didn't do anything!

00:08:56.440 --> 00:09:00.340
Normally it would startle most
people if a stranger suddenly

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.100
showed up in their own home.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.600
Hamaji, what have you been working on?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:10.410
The majority of the stems for
Ayane's flowers are broken.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.340
Here, Shino!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:13.740
Wh-what is it?

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.420
Supposedly Ayane is about
the same age as me.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.630
I'd love to have a friend
who is a fellow girl!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:23.250
Invite her to afternoon
tea and escort her here.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:27.020
That sounded like a death
sentence, didn't it?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.380
Yes, indeed.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:34.200
You see, the land here originally
belonged to the Mizuki family.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.960
There is even a legend about
a jealous guardian deity

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:41.800
that would devour any outsiders intruding upon its land.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:45.020
Do you think Shii will be all right?

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.900
I'm comin' in!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:56.400
Uh, excuse me! Is anyone around?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.920
Cheh! What is with this place?

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:14.080
Aw, crap! I'm already
trapped inside its barrier.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.180
Murasame?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:22.380
You don't need to force yourself out.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.060
I'll be fine.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:33.380
I see you keep something most fascinating
inside your body, Child.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.040
'Scuse me?!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:38.830
M-moron! Murasame, don't come out!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.130
Not only have you trespassed
onto my territory,

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.010
but you are uncouth as well.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:56.940
This is the Mizuki family's
guardian deity...

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:05.080
Did Satomi not warn you to
keep your distance from my domain?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.580
Huh? Yeah, but I brought some flowers...

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:11.500
You are the one who defied my ordinance.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:15.010
I cannot simply allow you to leave.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.380
I am terribly sorry for the intrusion!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.300
This is Shino Inuzuka
and I am Sosuke Inukawa.

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.710
You have my heartfelt apology

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.540
for entering your domain
without permission.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:33.640
Sosuke?!

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.820
Silence, Shino!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:39.000
This is your fault for not
heeding Mr. Satomi's warning.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.060
We have no right to complain
if he takes our lives.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:49.150
You harbor something fascinating
in your body as well.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.570
Or rather, it is sealed within you.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.360
Why not put everything to an end now

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.500
and return to the cycle of man?

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:01.290
No...

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.250
This one shares its life with me.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.010
I am the one who chose to
accept it as my other half.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:14.270
For the sake of those around me,
I wish to continue living out my life.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.110
You are both impudent children.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.300
But it is a fact that you
have defied my ordinance.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:24.380
Leave an arm before you go.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:27.820
If my arm would buy your forgiveness...

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:28.720
Wha-?!

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.340
S-Sosuke!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.390
Interesting.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:38.230
In that case, sever
your own arm and offer it to me.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:43.240
Don't do it!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.610
Stop it!

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:48.200
Ayane...

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:52.420
Master Chikage, how
could you be so cruel?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:56.310
A-aren't those men supposed to be
Rio's honored guests?

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.000
But they defied my ordinance.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:01.220
So what if they did?

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.500
Weren't they here to
deliver some flowers?

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:04.510
But you...

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.750
I hate you, Master Chikage!

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.280
Sorry 'bout that.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.580
This just had to happen when
you don't feel yourself.

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.780
You've got that right.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.780
This is precisely why I asked you

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.780
to spend the day quietly by my side.

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.930
Hamaji asked me to go.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.790
And that Osaki lad knew you were going

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.850
but didn't stop you, right?

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.210
How is your arm?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:42.950
It stopped bleeding a while ago.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.330
Murasame will take over from there.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.560
I'll be fine, so feel
free to go back to sleep!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.930
Excuse me... I'm sorry about
what happened earlier.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.280
It looked like you were injured, so...

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.530
I-I-I-I am sorry! I
didn't mean to intrude.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.120
Stop right there, Ayane!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.170
My name...?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.340
Effective Vitamins
Health Drink
Vitality

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:18.680
Um, uh, thank you for the flowers.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.830
The way you arranged them was adorable.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:23.420
Don't thank me. Thank Hamaji.

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.540
Hamaji...?

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:27.520
My childhood friend.

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.340
She said that she wanted
to become friends with you, Ayane.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.590
Friends...?

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:38.600
She's a bit bossy, but it'd make me
happy if you were pals.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.570
B-but look at me...

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.330
What's wrong?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.320
My hair is pure white and
my eyes are a strange color.

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.870
Sh-she might think I'm creepy.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.410
Creepy?

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:55.460
I'd bet "creepy" is more like what you'd use
to describe this guy here.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:56.880
Right, Murasame?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.640
See?

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:04.430
D-doesn't it scare you?

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.480
Nah. I'd be dead without him.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:12.550
I think the fact that I haven't aged
in five years is way scarier.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:16.140
You've been this way
for five whole years?

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.140
More or less.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.570
What if you stayed like that forever...?

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.730
What if you were all alone,
abandoned by time itself...?

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.400
Doesn't that scare you?

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.030
It does!

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:32.400
But I believe that as long
as I'm alive, I'm not alone.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.440
He has such determined eyes...

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:39.800
So...

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:44.600
Hamaji ordered me to invite you over
for afternoon tea.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:45.730
How 'bout it?

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.250
I'll go.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.020
Watch. Just like this!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:55.770
See?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:16:01.260
Two girls together make for
a truly pleasant sight.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.280
They are both adorable.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:06.570
I am amazed that Master
Chikage allowed her to go.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:11.320
Mizuki children are highly sensitive
to the auras of others.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.380
I do not mean to speak ill of Hamaji,

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:16.950
but was it wise to let
them meet so suddenly?

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.010
Well, I don't see why not.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:23.580
She seemed to be
just fine when she was with Shii.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.060
Hrm. That child's aura is terrifying.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.060
Perhaps sheathing Murasame
in his body is to blame,

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.740
but it makes my hair stand on end
whenever he draws near.

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:36.980
That is a foe to all spirits!
'Tis truly fearsome.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.780
Just the other day, Yatsufusa and I-

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:40.610
Hey!

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.850
Kaname! Hey, Kaname!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.180
Yes?

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:50.330
Ayane just told me that there is a festival
in the Imperial Capital.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.370
Yeah! Although it is a festival,

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.330
it is a subdued lantern
festival held to send the

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.960
spirits of the dead to the other side.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.370
Care to go?

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.100
Sure would! Right, Ayane?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:06.390
Well... I may not be able to.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.880
Why not? It's a rare treat!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:12.170
I would have to ask Master
Chikage for permission.

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:16.260
You might not get to go, Ayane.

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.070
Master Chikage probably won't

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.540
authorize you to visit
the outside world.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.020
You are too weak.

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.020
I could handle it.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:31.650
That is for Master Chikage to decide,
just as he always has.

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.800
So, what's up? Did you need me?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:56.430
I am unable to grant that
child any of her desires.

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:02.530
The babe that was eventually born into
the Mizuki family was like me.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.880
She lacked any coloring.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.270
She is weak.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:10.530
Such is the price she must
pay to receive my blessings.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:14.700
She is weak, therefore she
cannot interact with humans.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.000
She only hears my voice.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:21.340
Yeah, but Ayane can't become you.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.990
In the end, she's a normal person.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.060
When humans reach the end
of their lifespans, they pass away.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.170
For you, that time must
feel like mere moments.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.990
I do not wish to shackle her.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:37.750
However, I cannot let her leave my side.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.970
Yet having said that, I
cannot leave this land.

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:45.290
Talk about a pain!

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:48.050
I have lived too long.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.080
My body has already become too large.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.630
When I move, the Earth shakes.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.290
You are a Great Serpent.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.380
Oh, I guess you're already
a regional deity.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.840
But if that's the case...

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:03.990
Why don't you borrow Osaki's foxes
whenever Ayane goes out?

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:06.720
Osaki's foxes...?

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.140
They dance to Hamaji's
every beck and call.

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:13.640
Those darn foxes are
super nice to girls!

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:15.350
Right, Osaki?

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:19.310
I can't believe you! Hamaji is special.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.800
Naturally, the same is true of Ayane.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.310
Master Chikage...

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:30.300
Um, I... I know that I am so weak

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.590
that I could not survive without you.

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:36.640
I understand that you
are keeping me alive.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:41.970
I may be the last living
member of the Mizuki family,

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.250
but I was able to pull through because of you.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.130
Master Chikage, you are
by no means my shackles.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.310
I wanted to live!

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:03.980
Isn't it pretty?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.190
Aren't you glad we got to come, Ayane?

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:08.460
Yep!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.440
Kaname, thank you.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.450
You are most welcome.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:13.900
Be sure to thank Kinko.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.660
Thank you for protecting me, Kin.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.260
Did you just call me "Kin"?!

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.010
Hamaji, what are you doing?

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.950
I heard this is also called
"purging sleepiness".

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.300
It chases away your sleepiness.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:33.100
So it's like a way to ward off evil.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.250
I'm doing it on behalf of Sosuke.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:38.770
It'd stink if you had to
sleep all day each time

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.010
there was a New Moon.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.310
He's falling down on
his job as a watchdog.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.820
I think I see why Kaname and Shino
are unable to defy Hamaji.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:50.530
Well, yeah... And we
don't care to, either.

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:51.610
What was that?

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.110
Shino Inuzuka.

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:05.380
Huh? What is it?

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.920
Accident in Forest
Near Imperial Capital

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.020
You have my gratitude.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:11.070
Thank you for serving as mediator
between Osaki and me.

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.190
I didn't do all that much.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.080
You gave Ayane a friend.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:21.190
A friend of Ayane's is
also a friend of mine.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:22.840
Chikage...

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.650
"Chikage" is not my true name.

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.260
Dear friend,

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:32.110
Murasame, which resides in your body,

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:33.970
is a sword capable of slaying even the gods.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.950
I find that power terrifying.

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:40.570
But I shall place my faith in you...

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.890
My name is Hibiki.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:47.860
Be certain to remember it.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:54.490
We're friends, huh?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
Stashed

00:23:27.430 --> 00:23:29.980
Kin, I just made this. Give it a try.

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:32.800
Goodness! Ayane made this from scratch.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:33.850
Thank you for the snack.

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:36.780
Is it good?

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:38.810
Hamaji taught me how
to make herbal muffins.
